description	"Jedi Apostate

A Jedi who minimizes Lightsaber skills in favor of high Force talent.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 10% faster RoF
- Lightsaber (Cyan/Blue)
-- Saber/Blaster Defense (1)
-- 8% more damage
-- 35% more special damage
-- EX Saber Throw (3) ^3[CS1]
--- 33% more damage
- Force Stun (12) (Bowcaster 1)
-- Slows on hit
-- 15% more velocity
-- 100% less damage/FP drain
-- 85% slower RoF
-- Primary fire only

^5Force Powers:
- Jump (1)
- Push (2)
- Pull (3)
- Drain (2) ^3[CS2]
- Grip (3) ^3[CS3]
- Mind Trick (1) ^3[CS4]

^8Attributes:
- Miraluka Vision (3)
- Sense Immunity
- Anti-Mind Trick (2)
- Healing (1)
- Force Block (2)
- Force Focus (3)
- 10% less knockback taken"